  {
    "html": "<div style=\"--color-tangerine-tag:#f69251;--color-midnight-ink:#181825;--color-carbon:#000000;--color-stone:#636363;--color-pebble:#949494;--color-fog:#f7f7f7;--color-snow:#ffffff;--color-graphite:#484758;--font-pp-radio-grotesk-light:'DM Sans',sans-serif;--font-inter:Inter,sans-serif;--spacing-8:8px;--spacing-12:12px;--spacing-16:16px;--spacing-24:24px;--spacing-32:32px;--shadow-subtle:rgba(24,24,37,0.12) 0px 2px 3px -2px;padding:40px 24px;background:var(--color-fog);display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><div style=\"background:var(--color-snow);border-radius:24px;padding:var(--spacing-24);max-width:270px;width:100%;box-shadow:var(--shadow-subtle);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-inter);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-midnight-ink);margin:0 0 var(--spacing-32) 0;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">\"We recently integrated this app into our Shopify Plus store, and it's an easy CRO quick win. By providing real-time guidance, it increases conversions and reduces product returns.\"</p></div><div><div style=\"width:100%;height:1px;background:#ebebeb;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-24);\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--spacing-12);\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c4a882,#8b7355);flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-inter);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-carbon);letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.3;\">Guillaume A.</div><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-inter);font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-stone);letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.4;margin-top:2px;\">E-shop Manager @DelseyParis</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:var(--color-snow);border-radius:24px;padding:var(--spacing-24);max-width:270px;width:100%;box-shadow:var(--shadow-subtle);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-inter);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-midnight-ink);margin:0 0 var(--spacing-32) 0;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">\"Providing advice and decision-making support is a key priority at Oh My Cream. The results of the first module have fully lived up to our expectations.\"</p></div><div><div style=\"width:100%;height:1px;background:#ebebeb;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-24);\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--spacing-12);\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a8c4a0,#5a7a52);flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-inter);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-carbon);letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.3;\">Sarah Mandel Azran</div><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-inter);font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-stone);letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.4;margin-top:2px;\">Head of e-commerce & digital @OhMyCream</div></div></div></div></div></div>",
    "name": "Testimonial Card",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<div style=\"--color-tangerine-tag:#f69251;--color-midnight-ink:#181825;--color-carbon:#000000;--color-stone:#636363;--color-pebble:#949494;--color-ash:#8b8b8b;--color-fog:#f7f7f7;--color-snow:#ffffff;--color-dusty-rose:#c97b84;--font-inter:Inter,sans-serif;--spacing-8:8px;--spacing-12:12px;--spacing-16:16px;--spacing-24:24px;--shadow-subtle:rgba(24,24,37,0.12) 0px 2px 3px -2px;padding:40px 24px;background:var(--color-fog);\"><div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--color-snow);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-subtle);overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-dusty-rose);\"></div><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#e8b84b;\"></div><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#6abf69;\"></div></div><div style=\"padding:var(--spacing-16) var(--spacing-24);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-16);\"><div style=\"width:100px;height:14px;background:#e5e5e5;border-radius:4px;\"></div><div style=\"width:180px;height:14px;background:#e5e5e5;border-radius:4px;\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:14px;background:#e5e5e5;border-radius:4px;\"></div><div style=\"width:28px;height:14px;background:#e5e5e5;border-radius:4px;\"></div><div style=\"width:28px;height:14px;background:#e5e5e5;border-radius:4px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f0f0f0;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-16);\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:var(--spacing-24);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-16);\"><div style=\"width:80px;height:12px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:4px;\"></div><div style=\"width:100px;height:12px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:4px;\"></div><div style=\"width:70px;height:12px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:4px;\"></div><div style=\"width:90px;height:12px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:4px;\"></div><div style=\"width:60px;height:12px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:4px;\"></div></div><div style=\"height:1px;background:#f0f0f0;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-24);\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:var(--spacing-24);\"><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:var(--spacing-12);margin-bottom:var(--spacing-12);\"><div style=\"width:48px;height:140px;background:#ececec;border-radius:8px;\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;height:140px;background:#ececec;border-radius:8px;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" style=\"opacity:0.3;\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><div style=\"width:100%;height:80px;background:#ececec;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-12);\"></div><div style=\"width:70%;height:12px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-8);\"></div><div style=\"width:50%;height:12px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:var(--spacing-8);\"></div><div style=\"width:90px;height:10px;background:#e0e0e0;border-radius:4px;\"></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
    "name": "Product Screenshot Browser Frame",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "name": "Primary CTA Button (Orange Pill)",
    "role": "Hero and nav primary action \u2014 'Book a demo'",
    "description": "Background #f69251, text #000000, border-radius 28px, padding 12px 24px. The fully pill-shaped silhouette at 28px radius is the only rounded element class in an otherwise angular layout. Subtle layered shadow: rgba(0,0,0,0.04) 0px 1px 2px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px 2px 4px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px 4px 8px. Font: Inter 14-16px weight 500."
  },
  {
    "name": "Ghost CTA Button (White Pill)",
    "role": "Secondary actions on dark or image-backed surfaces",
    "description": "Background #ffffff, text #000000, border-radius 28px, padding 12px 24px. Same pill shape as primary, but inverted to white fill \u2014 reads as outline-adjacent without an explicit border. Used where orange would clash with background."
  },
  {
    "name": "Email Input + CTA Inline Form",
    "role": "Hero email capture row",
    "description": "Input field: transparent background, border-radius 0px, no padding \u2014 appears as a bare underline or bordered rectangle. Paired inline with the orange pill button. Input text #000000, placeholder color #949494 (Pebble). The zero-radius input contrasts sharply with the 28px pill button beside it, creating a deliberate tension between form and function."
  },
  {
    "name": "Testimonial Card",
    "role": "Social proof in scrolling testimonials section",
    "description": "White (#ffffff) card surface, border-radius 24px, padding 24px. Quote text in Inter 14-16px #181825. Author name in Inter 500 ~14px, role/handle in #636363 Inter 400 12-13px. Avatar image displayed at small size (32-40px) with circular crop. No border \u2014 card lifts via box-shadow rgba(24,24,37,0.12) 0px 2px 3px -2px. Placed in a horizontal scroll carousel."
  },
  {
    "name": "Product Screenshot Browser Frame",
    "role": "Product tour / hero UI illustration",
    "description": "White (#ffffff) card at border-radius 24px with decorative browser chrome: three colored dots (red #c97b84, yellow, green) in top-left at 12px circles. Interior filled with skeleton placeholder blocks at #f7f7f7 and #b2b2b2. Card uses rgba(247,247,247,0.5) 0px -40px 40px 0px shadow at bottom edge \u2014 a fade-up vignette that blends the mockup into the page background."
  },
  {
    "name": "Navigation Bar",
    "role": "Global top navigation",
    "description": "White (#ffffff) background, height ~64px, max-width contained. Logo (Dialog wordmark with arrow icon) left-aligned. Links in Inter 400 14px #636363, spacing 6-8px gaps. 'Book a demo' orange pill button right-aligned. Border-radius 32px on the nav container when scrolled (floating pill nav pattern). No visible bottom border \u2014 separates from page via background contrast."
  },
  {
    "name": "Feature Badge / Pill Label",
    "role": "Category tags, section labels like 'AI product recommender'",
    "description": "Border-radius 100px, background white or #f7f7f7, padding 4-8px 12px. Text Inter 500 12-13px #484758. No colored background \u2014 neutral pill that organizes content without adding chroma."
  },
  {
    "name": "Section Heading Block",
    "role": "Main headline + supporting subtext for each content section",
    "description": "Headline: PP Radio Grotesk Light 50px, letter-spacing -0.01em, color #000000, line-height 1.20. Subtext: Inter 400 16-18px #636363, line-height 1.50. Vertically stacked, center-aligned in hero, left-aligned in feature sections. Gap between headline and subtext: 12-16px."
  },
  {
    "name": "Star Rating Row",
    "role": "Social proof trust indicators below hero CTA",
    "description": "Inline row of icon + 5-star glyphs in #f69251 orange. Icon badge (Shopify/G2 logo) at 20px followed by five \u2605 characters. Text Inter 400 12px #636363. Two rating rows displayed side-by-side with 16-24px gap. Acts as micro-credibility anchor beneath the email capture form."
  }
]
